{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a fine autumn day, and there are thousands of choices to make.<br><br>OTHERS is a looping story game about thoughts where you unlock new voices in your head, driving new ideas, new scenarios, and new endings.<br><br>Depending on the choices you make, your story could end immediately or even last for half an hour. But regardless of the length, you will reach an ending. Maybe it wasn't the one you wanted, or maybe it was. Regardless, the next time around, you will have new voices in your head, new options, and new endings to find.<br>  <br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voice-acted</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six Looping Story endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Final Story endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic <strong>text-based</strong> and <strong>point-and-click controls</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morally ambiguous voices</strong> to listen to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A<strong> Looping Storyline</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067150?t=1759338445","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067150/82916600def4d2b59af95dd4206ed2dc3418d59f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759338445","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067150/f28e802eddca81c3148bc278dc60adc63105630e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759338445","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067150/f28e802eddca81c3148bc278dc60adc63105630e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759338445","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76